{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/6582737f97300534bb5f514955dbe9eb.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inquisitor Augustine has lost his mind, plunging Portonero into fear. You must step in, investigate suspicious villagers, uncover the truth behind the chaos and end the reign of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the obsessive inquisitor Augustine, discover hidden clues in Portonero, and solve hundreds of puzzles to bring peace back to the terrified villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/0b3d6b81c78fc76771061aed8fa0a724.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- BONUS CHAPTER &quot;Mark My Words!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- re-playable MINI-GAMES  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- re-playable HIDDEN OBJECT scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ART BOOK and SOUNDTRACK </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complete integrated STRATEGY GUIDE  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/413470/extras/e2765eafb219bf93f1a5652e4673a587.avif?t=1762945901\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure \u2013 investigate\u00a0 scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games \u2013 mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/413470/14cd4ca8cc1b25c59578a16353f420a82546ac62.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/413470/26047d56945954c383c3e4e3c7b8f4b82d7f9bbb.jpg"},{"name":"Chosen One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/413470/dd53492a226e23e7aab4f9f7fa2fb705edc878ed.jpg"},{"name":"Minigame Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/413470/b7797badfe7d1c3c3458412fd8f2a9282b5d0743.jpg"},{"name":"Minigame Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/413470/c12c3cc62a6ca5838a2b7db5095f1ed